---
export const prerender = true;
import ShopLayout from '../layouts/ShopLayout.astro';
---
<ShopLayout
  title="Crema Spalmabile al Cioccolato | Dimensione Dolce"
  description="Crema spalmabile artigianale al cioccolato fondente monorigine e nocciole Piemonte IGP. Senza olio di palma, senza conservanti."
>

  <!-- ========== BREADCRUMB ========== -->
  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Percorso di navigazione">
    <div class="breadcrumb__inner">
      <a href="/" class="breadcrumb__link">Home</a>
      <span class="breadcrumb__sep">/</span>
      <a href="/shop" class="breadcrumb__link">Shop</a>
      <span class="breadcrumb__sep">/</span>
      <span class="breadcrumb__current">Crema Spalmabile al Cioccolato</span>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- ========== PRODUCT DETAIL ========== -->
  <section class="pdp">
    <div class="pdp__inner">

      <!-- Left: Gallery -->
      <div class="pdp__gallery">
        <div class="pdp__img-main clip-reveal-left">
          <img src="/assets/img/product-crema.png" alt="Crema Spalmabile al Cioccolato Fondente">
        </div>
        <div class="pdp__img-secondary fade-in-up delay-2">
          <img src="/assets/img/hero-crema.png" alt="Crema Spalmabile - dettaglio">
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Product Info -->
      <div class="pdp__info">
        <span class="pdp__label fade-in-right delay-1" style="background-color: var(--cioccolato);">ARTIGIANALE</span>

        <h1 class="pdp__title fade-in-right delay-1">La Crema</h1>

        <p class="pdp__subtitle fade-in-right delay-2" style="color: var(--cioccolato);">Crema Spalmabile al Cioccolato</p>

        <p class="pdp__price fade-in-right delay-2">&euro;18,00</p>

        <!-- Weight Selector -->
        <div class="pdp__weight-selector fade-in-right delay-3">
          <span class="pdp__weight-label">Formato</span>
          <div class="pdp__weight-options">
            <input type="radio" name="weight" id="weight-200" value="200" class="pdp__weight-option" checked>
            <label for="weight-200">200g</label>
            <input type="radio" name="weight" id="weight-400" value="400" class="pdp__weight-option">
            <label for="weight-400">400g</label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Description -->
        <p class="pdp__desc fade-in-right delay-3">
          Nasce dalla stessa passione che mettiamo nei nostri panettoni. Cioccolato fondente
          monorigine del Madagascar, con le sue note fruttate e avvolgenti, viene fuso lentamente
          e unito a nocciole Piemonte IGP tostate nel nostro laboratorio a bassa temperatura
          per preservarne tutto l'aroma. Nessun olio di palma, nessun conservante, nessun
          compromesso. Solo ingredienti puri, lavorati con cura artigianale. Perfetta spalmata
          su pane caldo, brioche appena sfornate, oppure gustata direttamente al cucchiaio
          per un momento di puro piacere.
        </p>

        <!-- Ingredients Accordion -->
        <div class="pdp__accordion fade-in-right delay-4" id="ingredientsAccordion">
          <div class="pdp__accordion-header" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            <span class="pdp__accordion-title">Ingredienti</span>
            <svg class="pdp__accordion-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="pdp__accordion-body">
            <div class="pdp__accordion-content">
              Nocciole Piemonte IGP tostate (40%), zucchero di canna integrale,
              cioccolato fondente monorigine Madagascar (massa di cacao, zucchero,
              burro di cacao) (25%), cacao magro in polvere (8%), burro di cacao,
              estratto naturale di vaniglia Bourbon del Madagascar.
              Puo contenere tracce di latte e soia.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <button class="pdp__cta fade-in-right delay-4">AGGIUNGI AL CARRELLO</button>

        <p class="pdp__shipping fade-in-right delay-5">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          Spedizione gratuita sopra &euro;80
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== POTREBBE PIACERTI ANCHE ========== -->
  <section class="related">
    <div class="related__inner">
      <h2 class="related__title fade-in-up">Potrebbe piacerti anche</h2>

      <div class="related__scroll">

        <!-- Related: Pistacchio -->
        <div class="related__card fade-in-up delay-1">
          <div class="related__card-image">
            <img src="/assets/img/box-pistacchio.png" alt="Panettone al Pistacchio">
          </div>
          <div class="related__card-body">
            <h3 class="related__card-name">Il Pistacchio</h3>
            <p class="related__card-price">&euro;45,00</p>
            <a href="/product-pistacchio" class="related__card-cta">Scopri</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Related: Cioccolato -->
        <div class="related__card fade-in-up delay-2">
          <div class="related__card-image">
            <img src="/assets/img/box-cioccolato.png" alt="Panettone Triplo Cioccolato">
          </div>
          <div class="related__card-body">
            <h3 class="related__card-name">Il Cioccolato</h3>
            <p class="related__card-price">&euro;42,00</p>
            <a href="/product-cioccolato" class="related__card-cta">Scopri</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</ShopLayout>
